dubious ownership, a long warning ahead of a corrupt index, subdirectory and linked-worktree report notes; ran 24 guard mutations including FIFO, fallbacks and index protection; ran the planned pose tools and both validate commands.\",\n \"criteria\": [\n  {\"id\":\"assumption-integrity\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N23\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-concurrency\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-contracts\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N23\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-input-errors\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N24\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-integration-impact\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/check-git-spawns-integration\"},\n  {\"id\":\"backend-observability\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N24\"},\n  {\"id\":\"compatibility\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N23\"},\n  {\"id\":\"correctness\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N23\"},\n  {\"id\":\"design-causality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"structure:design-1c8a3d3c63eb7a6a\",\"rationale\":\"D2 removes the stat-then-open race and keeps FIFOs from blocking (both mutations fail tests); D1 and L1 rest on measured Git behaviour; rewritten D3 removes the cause of R3-N18 by not classifying from text. Its resolution step is too narrow and drops causes, recorded as N23 and N24. The sealed design assessment lists no structural deltas.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"documentation\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N24\"},\n  {\"id\":\"operability\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N24\"},\n  {\"id\":\"requirements\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"evidence\":\"N24\"},\n  {\"id\":\"scope\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/artifact-claim-boundary-integration\",\"rationale\":\"The 13 implementation files are the ones the spec lists, artifact-check strict exits 0, and the round stays within R2 and D3; the behaviour change it